{"id": "1554227215783297105", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "You got the general idea. Both these teams look fine for early game. One downside of the first team is no source of Vuln. You could replace Winkle with Erica once you get her for free via clearing story.", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T20:24:04.388000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["419633107583631365"], "reply_to": "1554225284276944967"}
