{"id": "1554228711233159179", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "For Sanga, you will be fueling you OE/Exalt as much as possible so “Strike” and “Defense” and “Exalt” everything is more fluff and be focused afterwards.\n\nFor Caecus, you want to level up pretty much everything. Focus on “Shattered Halberd” and “Rouse” and “Exalt” and “Protective Scales”, first.", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T20:30:00.931000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["114199441283481600"], "reply_to": "1554215889270739032"}
