{"id": "1554230789011669075", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "Support Oathbound for CoVs, goes TTW or Feast from Afar. \n\nDPS Oathbound goes TTB or Dreams of Medicine.\n\nComposition wise as Support, he works but is not BiS with Mouch, Dore, Sorel. Mouch wants Helpt thou, and Dore wants Leigh or/and Clem, and Sorel wants Thais. Both Dore and Sorel love Pickman too. \n\nAs DPS, he can is often ran with Hameln or/and S tier Supports/Survivability; Characters like Arachne/Castor/Horla/Clem. \n\nAs Support, he can also just be thrown in for Primordial Chaos Realm, but lots of teams hate the Realm. So some people just make DPS and that solves that. As DPS though, he is *very* mid or lower and needs AA. \n\nIf you are early game, you can can slap him on as a Stat stick or DPS, but oftentimes there are better choices.", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T20:38:16.312000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["238409970931073025"], "reply_to": "1554185457905045645"}
