{"id": "1554233463786307609", "channel_id": "1400749543288475770", "author_id": "393585313618067456", "author_name": "katesthio", "content": "As DPS, alot of investment is needed to make her work. As Support, she can slapped onto anything and be alright. \n\nIn early game, she can DPS and will be fine.\n\nYou can slap her on Fauxborn/Celeste/Jenkin, and replace Winkle or Celeste for Daffodil. Daff provides Vuln and utility like Draw and Aliemus. \n\nIf you wanna play her DPS, you can currently run and will work for now, Daffodil/Ogier/Winkle/Casiah or Jenkin or Ramona", "timestamp": "2026-09-28T20:48:54.028000+00:00", "type": 19, "mentions": ["419633107583631365"], "reply_to": "1554232078734991441"}
